00:00:37.400 --> 00:00:41.649
So here's some cool facts from the episode
that some of you guys pointed out in the comments.

00:00:41.649 --> 00:00:44.329
Feel free to shout if you were one of the
people that commented on these things. There

00:00:44.329 --> 00:00:45.899
