00:00:45.899 --> 00:00:50.739
First off, Tormund Giantsbane is replacing
the Val character from the books as the person

00:00:50.739 --> 00:00:53.870
they keep as a prisoner at the Night's Watch.

00:00:53.870 --> 00:00:59.530
Pip and Grenn weren't killed in the book.
I saw a lot of you that were more sad to see

00:00:59.530 --> 00:01:03.500
them go than you were to see Ygritte die,
which I thought was really funny.

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:09.090
and that battle between Jon Snow and the Thenn
at the end was an homage to Donal Noyal. He's

00:01:09.090 --> 00:01:13.429
a night's watch character from the book that
they cut out of the show. He was the blacksmith.

00:01:13.429 --> 00:01:17.600
Which is why Jon rolls over the forge and
kills the thenn with the Blacksmith's hammer.

00:01:17.600 --> 00:01:21.329
In the books Donal was the one who went into
the tunnel to keep the giant from entering

00:01:21.329 --> 00:01:22.490
castle black instead of that group of night's
watch brothers.

00:01:22.490 --> 00:01:27.810
and Japanese Zombies suggested that the girl
maester aemon was talking about was one of

00:01:27.810 --> 00:01:33.829
his sisters Rhae or Daella. Because that would
have been the Targaryen tradition. I don't

00:01:33.829 --> 00:01:38.399
know if it's true, but it's the best suggestion
I saw in the comments.

00:01:38.399 --> 00:01:41.450
So time to answer some questions. Careful
