it's Brienne unsheathing Oathkeeper, then

00:01:56.700 --> 00:02:00.909
it cuts to Arya and the Hound approaching
someone that looks like they're wearing armor

00:02:00.909 --> 00:02:01.489
like Brienne's.

00:02:01.489 --> 00:02:08.489
This would be a big departure from the books,
but a way to do something similar. I don't

00:02:09.390 --> 00:02:13.180
want to say what happened to any of those
characters in case book stuff turns into spoilers.

00:02:13.180 --> 00:02:19.090
But where things are now with Arya and the
Hound and Brienne and Podrick are really different.

00:02:19.090 --> 00:02:24.120
The show changed the way Ygritte died last
night but she did die during the attack in

00:02:24.120 --> 00:02:28.680
the books. So it's like they change things
but still end things in similar ways.

00:02:28.680 --> 00:02:31.740
Question 2 - Nicole asks What Happened to
Ghost?

00:02:31.740 --> 00:02:35.680
He's just hanging out recovering from the
battle. He's not dead or anything. They don't

00:02:35.680 --> 00:02:39.490
put the wolves in every scene because they
have to add CG to regular sized wolves and

00:02:39.490 --> 00:02:41.250
