00:02:41.250 --> 00:02:45.180
The dragons are really eating most of the
CG budget this season and they're a big part

00:02:45.180 --> 00:02:50.270
of the finale. So expect to get a crazy dragon
scene next week. It looked like Ghost didn't

00:02:50.270 --> 00:02:54.600
