probably won't see him next week. But he's

00:02:54.600 --> 00:02:54.960
just fine.

00:02:54.960 --> 00:03:01.480
No new direwolves have died since Nymeria
ran off and Lady and Grey Wind were killed.

00:03:01.480 --> 00:03:06.460
Question 3 - Fatema asks Why did Jon go to
Mance Rayder's Camp without a weapon?

00:03:06.460 --> 00:03:13.460
I saw a lot of you guys asking this question,
it's because Mance doesn't know what Jon has

00:03:13.770 --> 00:03:20.770
done. He still thinks he's with the raiders.
It's a bit of a plot hole, because if the

00:03:22.150 --> 00:03:27.580
raiders used a warg to learn their defences.
Why wouldn't Mance use a warg to do the same

00:03:27.580 --> 00:03:29.620
thing, and see Jon Snow wearing the black.

00:03:29.620 --> 00:03:33.600
The other reason he didn't take longclaw was
because he made a promise to never lose it

00:03:33.600 --> 00:03:37.720
again. So by leaving it with Sam he was insuring
that it wouldn't be lost if he got killed.

00:03:37.720 --> 00:03:42.650
Jon said he's going to try and kill him, but
I think they'll stick to the book plot. I

00:03:42.650 --> 00:03:46.069
won't say what that is just because spoilers,
and if you have read the books please use

00:03:46.069 --> 00:03:49.050
