00:06:03.270 --> 00:06:07.379
Dinklage definitely. I saw a chart after like
season 2 that compared the screen time everyone

00:06:07.379 --> 00:06:11.669
got and there were definitely a small group
of people that got way more compared to season

00:06:11.669 --> 00:06:16.289
1. Peter Dinklage has always gotten the most
even if you think Daenerys is the most important

00:06:16.289 --> 00:06:16.800
character.

00:06:16.800 --> 00:06:20.550
But generally the characters this year that
have gotten the biggest push have been tyrion,

00:06:20.550 --> 00:06:26.169
jaime and cersei, daenerys, and Jon Snow.
After that the rest of the lannisters and

00:06:26.169 --> 00:06:30.879
the starks get way less screen time and after
