00:06:52.139 --> 00:06:57.759
Question 9 - Lorie asks, was the wall built
to keep out white walkers or wildlings? Didn't

00:06:57.759 --> 00:06:59.319
giants help build it?

00:06:59.319 --> 00:07:04.949
The wall was built to seal off the lands of
always winter from the rest of Westeros. That's

00:07:04.949 --> 00:07:09.849
where the white walkers retreated to at the
end of the long winter. Yes giants helped

00:07:09.849 --> 00:07:14.419
and the free folk. Everyone that lived in
the north helped build the wall.

00:07:14.419 --> 00:07:18.770
The wall is about a thousand years old. So
it existed before the andals invaded and formed

00:07:18.770 --> 00:07:23.569
the seven kingdoms. That's when relations
with the first men who survived the invasion

00:07:23.569 --> 00:07:29.309
deteriorated. Anyone not wishing to bow to
a king just moved North of the wall. They

00:07:29.309 --> 00:07:32.369
became what you would call the wildlings.
But they're really called free folk.

00:07:32.369 --> 00:07:36.360
It's been so long since the last battle with
the white walkers that everyone has forgotten

00:07:36.360 --> 00:07:41.249
the wall isn't to keep the free folk out,
it's to keep the white walkers in.

00:07:41.249 --> 00:07:45.409
I did a big video on the long night and the
